WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Know what happens when you vote for PSDB?

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.500
You vote. He comes back.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
You vote. He comes back.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.500
You vote... and he's gone -

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.500
he flees and abandons office once again.
